{"symbol":"PSPL","yahoo":"PSPL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"PDP Shipping & Projects Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","website":"https://www.pdpprojects.com","about":"PDP Shipping & Projects Limited, an international freight forwarding company, provides shipping and logistics, and transport solutions through sea, air, rail, and road primarily in India. It offers international freight forwarding services; air and sea freight services; multimodal transportation services; custom clearance services; packaging, warehousing, transportation, and distribution services; integrated logistics solutions; and door-to-door logistic services. The company also provides breakbulk, heavy lift, and project cargo handling and shipping services; roll on\u0096roll off loadout and sea towage services; and total sea transportation engineering solutions. In addition, it offers special cargo services, including time bound shipment, exhibition cargo, and temperature critical cargo services; and over dimensional cargo handling services. The company serves heavy engineering, energy, defense, automobile, electronics, shipyards, EPC, infrastructure, FMCG, manufacturing, and other sectors. PDP Shipping & Projects Limited was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Navi Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T07:24:36+00:00","quote":{"price":52.01,"prevClose":58.65,"marketCap":15.47,"high52":71.0,"low52":46.7,"pe":12.32,"bookValue":67.92,"dividendRate":1.0,"roe":6.42,"shares":0.2974,"insiders":82.69,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-03-18","2025-03-19","2025-03-20","2025-03-21","2025-03-24","2025-03-25","2025-03-26","2025-03-27","2025-03-28","2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","2025-04-08","2025-04-09","2025-04-11","2025-04-15","2025-04-16","2025-04-17","2025-04-21","2025-04-22","2025-04-23","2025-04-24","2025-04-25","2025-04-28","2025-04-29","2025-04-30","2025-05-02","2025-05-05","2025-05-06","202